        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5fb5e815-2c01-326a-af32-570b78345f17",
                "word": "detailleren",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d576431e-f867-322f-bf02-61eeb0d1d208",
                        "entry_id": "5fb5e815-2c01-326a-af32-570b78345f17",
                        "glosses": [
                            "afwerken door het aanbrengen van kleine onderdelen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3936e55-69e5-4894-8ddd-ef5f15757137",
                                "sense_id": "d576431e-f867-322f-bf02-61eeb0d1d208",
                                "text": "De Zesde symfonie ‘Pastorale’ van Beethoven kreeg van Masur een magnifieke uitvoering, klassiek en liefdevol. Masur is een meester in het rustig detailleren met veel dynamische gradaties. En hij schildert met de orkestklank. Het weldadige gouden licht van het eerste deel werd wat diffuus in de ‘Szene am Bach’, om na de donder en bliksem weer fris te glinsteren. Zó wil men de Pastorale horen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a59d22d0-40f8-4efe-a0b9-67f33d356591",
                        "source_entry_id": "5fb5e815-2c01-326a-af32-570b78345f17",
                        "source_sense_id": "d576431e-f867-322f-bf02-61eeb0d1d208",
                        "target_lang_word": "specify",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "specify",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "041f9591-e235-3dcc-9b8f-498c6256cd23",
                                        "entry_id": "21f2bc7a-8d75-31f5-adbd-7464539eb430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To state explicitly, or in detail, or as a condition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "773028c4-ef1f-4294-98fc-51c3c7d89250",
                                                "sense_id": "041f9591-e235-3dcc-9b8f-498c6256cd23",
                                                "text": "I was nevere somouned, ne never hadde tydynges of this matier but by seyd lettres and other fleying tales that I heve herd sithen, ne nevere hadde to do more with the seyd John Wortes than is specified in the seyd instruccion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc1ccd3a-ed8f-4711-ba1d-8295254fad8c",
                                                "sense_id": "041f9591-e235-3dcc-9b8f-498c6256cd23",
                                                "text": "Thanne after came A riall ordenaunce, / Too myghty princes with a grete pusaunce, / ffro Masedeyn and owt of Arkadye, / Ther cowde no man the nowmber specifie.",
                                                "translation": "Then, after a royal ordinance, two mighty princes came and brought a great host of men from Macedonia and Arcadia, so many that no one could specify the number.",
                                                "english": "Then, after a royal ordinance, two mighty princes came and brought a great host of men from Macedonia and Arcadia, so many that no one could specify the number."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57391e7d-ce84-453c-9940-b6b25be35373",
                                                "sense_id": "041f9591-e235-3dcc-9b8f-498c6256cd23",
                                                "text": "But there is no need of specifying particulars in this class of uses. The catalogue is endless, and the examples so obvious, that I shall leave them to the reader’s reflection, with the general remark, that this mercenary benefit is one which has respect to a farther good. A man is fed, not that he may be fed, but that he may work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83425360-57d6-305f-a3d3-bc770b1a12d0",
                                        "entry_id": "21f2bc7a-8d75-31f5-adbd-7464539eb430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To include in a specification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df241916-cfaf-4ae0-b33a-0f0402d7b467",
                                                "sense_id": "83425360-57d6-305f-a3d3-bc770b1a12d0",
                                                "text": "It seems to me that whoever at the Department of Transport or the train operating companies, or both, is specifying the standard of seats these days has taken leave of their senses and opted for cheapness over comfort."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "834a8fc4-9ac3-3caa-b5f8-545107516b90",
                                        "entry_id": "21f2bc7a-8d75-31f5-adbd-7464539eb430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring about a specific result."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2119b352-67c6-3cd6-ad9c-a6f159b2690c",
                                        "entry_id": "21f2bc7a-8d75-31f5-adbd-7464539eb430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To speak explicitly or in detail (often used with of)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b851412-aa26-412e-b5b5-7e0ac83b02cf",
                                                "sense_id": "2119b352-67c6-3cd6-ad9c-a6f159b2690c",
                                                "text": "Forthermar o þis lecheri / Agh i þe noght to specifie[…]",
                                                "translation": "I will not speak explicitly about this lechery any further.",
                                                "english": "I will not speak explicitly about this lechery any further."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9fc4028c-27ca-48eb-a6df-70221bffe948",
                        "source_entry_id": "5fb5e815-2c01-326a-af32-570b78345f17",
                        "source_sense_id": "d576431e-f867-322f-bf02-61eeb0d1d208",
                        "target_lang_word": "detail",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "detail",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6de3385-e0e6-30e9-9850-71a31b0f0d10",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A part small enough to escape casual notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca91c88e-64b5-44cb-a555-27b6e147d114",
                                                "sense_id": "c6de3385-e0e6-30e9-9850-71a31b0f0d10",
                                                "text": "Note this fine detail in the lower left corner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b780a73c-2afd-4d63-882f-c3103d123652",
                                                "sense_id": "c6de3385-e0e6-30e9-9850-71a31b0f0d10",
                                                "text": "We missed several important details in the contract."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d71be30-c1d9-4766-9567-af18036a578d",
                                                "sense_id": "c6de3385-e0e6-30e9-9850-71a31b0f0d10",
                                                "text": "attention to detail"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9b2189b-83ed-3624-88a5-591fd949fde6",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A profusion of details."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8953f8eb-a8d9-45d5-ad7d-cef6c9bbbebe",
                                                "sense_id": "e9b2189b-83ed-3624-88a5-591fd949fde6",
                                                "text": "This etching is full of fine detail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6265104e-dde2-4cee-85ce-12bbcc8a71aa",
                                                "sense_id": "e9b2189b-83ed-3624-88a5-591fd949fde6",
                                                "text": "Hidden behind thickets of acronyms and gorse bushes of detail, a new great game is under way across the globe. Some call it geoeconomics, but it's geopolitics too. The current power play consists of an extraordinary range of countries simultaneously sitting down to negotiate big free trade and investment agreements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49fbc207-f860-3f43-bc5d-a9f317b50bfe",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The small parts that can escape casual notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aeaccb55-5295-4594-9cbe-a5837b4da9ce",
                                                "sense_id": "49fbc207-f860-3f43-bc5d-a9f317b50bfe",
                                                "text": "Attention to detail was said to be one of the secrets of Gerrard's success as a player."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5c37581-acb2-3e1e-a4f3-000f13807dc1",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A part considered trivial enough to ignore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "458d872e-b82c-4dd5-bc87-83d1e004e89b",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c37581-acb2-3e1e-a4f3-000f13807dc1",
                                                "text": "I don't concern myself with the details of accounting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1bc641-a767-432f-b10a-e0391c1e9231",
                                                "sense_id": "b5c37581-acb2-3e1e-a4f3-000f13807dc1",
                                                "text": "Safety at work is not a mere detail."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4a89177-1401-3857-aa97-62a710fef039",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person's name, address and other personal information."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59c3b693-5faa-4c3a-bccc-5b450d92d4dd",
                                                "sense_id": "b4a89177-1401-3857-aa97-62a710fef039",
                                                "text": "The arresting officer asked the suspect for his details."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a84ea44e-cf82-3385-a6e2-b939acbef3a7",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A temporary unit or assignment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddb02c00-da48-4b12-8efe-d3733b66bef1",
                                                "sense_id": "a84ea44e-cf82-3385-a6e2-b939acbef3a7",
                                                "text": "Frequently members of the small police detail dispatched to the scene joined in."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7a2de0e-5b01-3845-97f1-28ca1321d783",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An individual feature, fact, or other item, considered separately from the whole of which it is a part."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81860add-09e3-4234-8c01-b87b9eccb4f2",
                                                "sense_id": "d7a2de0e-5b01-3845-97f1-28ca1321d783",
                                                "text": "WikiLeaks did not cause these uprisings but it certainly informed them. The dispatches revealed details of corruption and kleptocracy that many Tunisians suspected, but could not prove, and would cite as they took to the streets. They also exposed the blatant discrepancy between the west's professed values and actual foreign policies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09ac6e8e-bbcb-3cc2-92e6-6dfeca1a43d1",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A narrative which relates minute points; an account which dwells on particulars."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbc91809-939d-48bb-9a6d-26c265fbdc31",
                                                "sense_id": "09ac6e8e-bbcb-3cc2-92e6-6dfeca1a43d1",
                                                "text": "\"I could never persuade myself to confide in him that event which was so often present to my recollection, but which I feared the detail to another would only impress more deeply.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6da3b7c3-dd0e-310d-b878-c0d327374e9e",
                                        "entry_id": "e8dd5ae5-af85-3d88-b5eb-3e1514eb4d76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A selected portion of a painting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19dedc66-bfc8-402a-b3a5-ee3bdb1c18b8",
                                                "sense_id": "6da3b7c3-dd0e-310d-b878-c0d327374e9e",
                                                "text": "Shrubbery and the hand of Christ (detail of plate 12)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00a93f22-b289-4a75-a843-8603979828d2",
                                                "sense_id": "6da3b7c3-dd0e-310d-b878-c0d327374e9e",
                                                "text": "On the cover of Julia Kristeva's Black Sun: Depression and Melancholia is a detail from a painting by Hans Holbein the Younger, “Portrait of the Artist's Wife, Elizabeth Binzenstock, and Her Two Children, Philip and Catherine.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5df33564-ef8f-425f-8d56-f259ea764f01",
                                                "sense_id": "6da3b7c3-dd0e-310d-b878-c0d327374e9e",
                                                "text": "Eight years later, the outstanding exponent of Memory Painting was herself publicly commemorated by a six-cent postage stamp showing a detail from one of her most patriotic works, July Fourth (1951)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "detail",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4b9db1e-e167-3062-a88a-6d2eee85a6ce",
                                        "entry_id": "975f4f87-5405-3d9c-8a07-702ed527f5d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To explain in detail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23f9a7ca-b54d-46f6-a32c-4bbfebd32e55",
                                                "sense_id": "b4b9db1e-e167-3062-a88a-6d2eee85a6ce",
                                                "text": "I'll detail the exact procedure to you later."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c950972-0957-4138-a6a6-24909be56982",
                                                "sense_id": "b4b9db1e-e167-3062-a88a-6d2eee85a6ce",
                                                "text": "It is a sunny morning in Amman and the three uniformed judges in Jordan’s state security court are briskly working their way through a pile of slim grey folders on the bench before them. Each details the charges against 25 or so defendants accused of supporting the fighters of the Islamic State (Isis), now rampaging across Syria and Iraq under their sinister black banners and sending nervous jitters across the Arab world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63b576fe-d776-32ce-9189-975b58dd714f",
                                        "entry_id": "975f4f87-5405-3d9c-8a07-702ed527f5d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To clean carefully (particularly of road vehicles, always pronounced. /ˈdiːteɪl/)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e37c27dc-1e5b-430a-9b00-1693349576b0",
                                                "sense_id": "63b576fe-d776-32ce-9189-975b58dd714f",
                                                "text": "We need to have the minivan detailed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "968a46c3-1e53-3b07-824b-f589393d0a53",
                                        "entry_id": "975f4f87-5405-3d9c-8a07-702ed527f5d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To assign to a particular task."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a385287-b3e5-4ac0-adb8-a3bc13a5999e",
                                                "sense_id": "968a46c3-1e53-3b07-824b-f589393d0a53",
                                                "text": "Two years after England’s World Cup victory, Stiles was at Wembley again to help Manchester United become the first English team to win the European Cup final. Again Eusébio was one of his opponents, playing for Benfica, and again Stiles was detailed to keep him quiet. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5fb5e696-0fae-4b43-8181-af183945ce7b",
                        "source_entry_id": "5fb5e815-2c01-326a-af32-570b78345f17",
                        "source_sense_id": "d576431e-f867-322f-bf02-61eeb0d1d208",
                        "target_lang_word": "détailler",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "détailler",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64f7a0c8-8b8a-3308-8f21-5ee3a9009f27",
                                        "entry_id": "c61dbc63-3c12-3cb9-86a5-fc6f5b35d9e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Couper en pièces, distribuer par parties."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5de843dc-97ca-4d24-a25d-f13d70db22c9",
                                                "sense_id": "64f7a0c8-8b8a-3308-8f21-5ee3a9009f27",
                                                "text": "Les aliments détaillés en menus morceaux sont sautés très rapidement avec très peu de matière grasse dans un récipient hémisphérique placé sur un brûleur très puissant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36ef3ded-c131-4e5c-a6ec-a3d1417786e6",
                                                "sense_id": "64f7a0c8-8b8a-3308-8f21-5ee3a9009f27",
                                                "text": "Alors que vider des poivrons tout en les gardant entiers pour pouvoir ensuite les garnir, on n’a jamais fait. Enlever la tige puis le secouer très fort au-dessus de l’évier pour évacuer les graines n’est sans doute pas une méthode que l’on apprend à l’école Bocuse, mais elle fonctionne (et ça détend après avoir détaillé 6 kg de légumes)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f03b0a06-495e-4ade-94d6-877fe6083c06",
                                                "sense_id": "64f7a0c8-8b8a-3308-8f21-5ee3a9009f27",
                                                "text": "Agiter le sucre dans sa tasse de café pour qu’il fonde plus vite, couper ses spaghettis, détailler une pomme en petits morceaux piqués ensuite au bout du couteau, autant de gestes oubliés que je retrouvais en lui, de façon troublante."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92caf58c-9aab-3d61-8eb5-2c09426c6de8",
                                        "entry_id": "c61dbc63-3c12-3cb9-86a5-fc6f5b35d9e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Débiter, vendre au détail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "027b9e0a-a5e3-441b-b127-1fdc15a9bd2b",
                                                "sense_id": "92caf58c-9aab-3d61-8eb5-2c09426c6de8",
                                                "text": "Il n’a pu vendre ses marchandises en gros, il a été contraint de les détailler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1fa6fc0-dc6d-32ae-baac-6bb27ea4906b",
                                        "entry_id": "c61dbc63-3c12-3cb9-86a5-fc6f5b35d9e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Raconter, exposer en détail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "def65747-2147-4d86-85f3-d266d30f8878",
                                                "sense_id": "c1fa6fc0-dc6d-32ae-baac-6bb27ea4906b",
                                                "text": "Dans certains combats, ce n’est pas seulement une lutte chorégraphiée, détaille Loïc Quinet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0fdac11d-3bc4-3e1e-88d1-67ab36eecd52",
                                        "entry_id": "c61dbc63-3c12-3cb9-86a5-fc6f5b35d9e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Observer dans les détails."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3c103f7-4021-4327-a2db-36c510d0001f",
                                                "sense_id": "0fdac11d-3bc4-3e1e-88d1-67ab36eecd52",
                                                "text": "Céline Thiébault était alors une jeune fille « bienfaisante », une de ces grandes filles brunes qui paraissent vingt ans au lieu de quinze, de celles qu'à la campagne on compare volontiers à une pouliche et que les hommes, vieux et jeunes, détaillent avec une basse envie, un violent désir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "053241e8-3674-44e4-b337-c5358420f0f1",
                                                "sense_id": "0fdac11d-3bc4-3e1e-88d1-67ab36eecd52",
                                                "text": "Il détaillait ma beauté, un cri d'extase pour mes yeux, un béement prolongé pour mes mains, un sifflement coquin pour mes jambes, un silence bien préparé pour ma poitrine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c07fda1-232d-4c7c-9964-22c2f133fbbe",
                                                "sense_id": "0fdac11d-3bc4-3e1e-88d1-67ab36eecd52",
                                                "text": "Il visita la Grande Galerie dont il détailla la splendeur, la parqueterie, les pilastres de marbre, les bronzes et les antiques qui paraissaient s'aboucher à travers les trois cent cinquante-sept miroirs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
